<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Arum</book>
  <para style="h">TITUS</para>
  <para style="toc1">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO BULUS A NA NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">TITUS</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Titus tana a bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh reh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Ablusu, mya nza ni bu ahwra Nnoh tasa kyangwri sa tsifa nana Yeso Kristi bleh, ma a tohmoh meh la meh ti na ni bleh tsifa nga agohsoh ma amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh tasa tsifa a zizi ata nza a ka a de agohsoh ikata Nnoh a ba. <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />Tsifa a zizi ata areh a ka a nga mboh wuwa agohsoh la mboh ma a bu na fene ata tuma atono ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya anyi avoh amehmeh feh masa a lisa inziyo, Nnoh reh a ka a huru tsifa kpeh, <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />na ameh ata nza a bu yehlehleh Nnoh ata nza a sa meh a hwana ka a tohmoh meh la meh ti hwra tsifa reh bleh tre atsifi.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Titus, mya meh ŋa ba na anzoh noh ni bu amehreh amya ata a zizi nimeh nga agohsoh:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 1:4">Meh kwere Nnoh Ada ambohroh tasa Yeso Kristi kyangwri sa reh hwana reh la ta a lisa nnoh alindeh tasa ta a te nnoh atoh na tuma alindeh.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndohmoh Titus Ma Akpo Afiya Kirit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Mya meh yi nnoh ta ma Kirit la ti te mgbiri ndohmoh ata nza a treh a hwa tasa ti seh agbugba mboh ma akpokpo afiyafiya, tswanza mya nza ni tsana noh reh. <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />Agba ata nza a te ndohmoh ma ida Nnoh ta a bu kyangwri ata nza ma a sohroh a ŋa ŋoh na andromboh abibi kpeh, ta a bu na afya anyimbehreh, mara a ŋoh mboh mata a bu amboh nga agohsoh tasa mata a sohroh a ŋa mboh ma aki te nyo ha ma aki wuwa ikpi kpeh. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />La mata a sohroh a ŋa kyangwri te ndohmoh Nnoh na andromboh abibi kpeh, ta kama a bu kyangwri gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka kpeh, ta kama a bu kyangwri te gofo na gbugbo kpeh, ta kama a bu kyangwri wa awumu te fya kpeh, ta kama a kira mlana kpeh, ta kama a bu kyangwri kira hungroh gaga kpeh. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Ŋoh neh ta a bu kyangwri sa sene mboh, ta a kira lisa andromboh alindeh, ta a wina de ikpi a ŋoh tasa ta a lisa andromboh alindeh, ta a bu kyangwri ata nza a kira ta a te ndohmoh Nnoh tasa de ikpi a ŋoh alindeh kanga. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Kyangwri te ndohmoh ida Nnoh ta a wina de tsifa a zizi ata nza ma a tsana ŋoh reh, tasa ta a tsana ma mgbiri kyangwri mboh tsifa a zizi reh tasa ta a tsana la amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa a zizi reh a leke ma a bu abibi.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Kyangwri amboh anyi ma a yama ma a leh a hehndeh a nata ma kyangwri mboh na tsifa shimba kpanda la a bu aki hunji nvara. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Ni nati ha nnoh tsifa amoh reh kanga, la ma a leh a tsana andromboh ata nza a bu abibi ata nza a zohhoh mata tsana kpeh la mboh mata a hunji hungroh. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Kyangwri wina lomo a bleh anyi nimeh amoh tana a bleh zizi la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri Kirit mboh ma a bu amboh agugu, agugu uwo aye mboh, tasa amboh yangru nza maka a lutu rya&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Tsifa reh a bu zizi, nza a bu dehreh hwa mboh nnoh heri, la mata a bu amboh nga agohsoh mboh, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />mata kama a kya ashotoh na tsifa huru tsifa Yahudawa mboh reh kpeh tasa akpi kyangwri mboh nza ma a leke tsifa a zizi reh. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Kyangwri ata agohsoh a ŋoh nza a bu fyafya, neh awumu mboh za maka a zanana mboh, neh amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a bu na nga agohsoh kpeh awumu za a ka a bu abibi na a ŋoh za la agohsoh a ŋoh kǝ te abibi. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Kyangwri amboh ika ata wohroh maka a tsana la ma a wina Nnoh, neh ndohmoh amoh a tsana la ma a sohroh a wina Nnoh kpeh, maka a sehneh tsifa, tasa za ma za a wina lisa andromboh alindeh kpeh.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Tsana Ata Nza A bu Yelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Nnoh Titus neh, tsana amboh tufa mboh andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh nimeh tsifa Nnoh reh kanga. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Tsana agbugba kyangwri mboh mata a wina de ikpi amoh, la mata a nga mboh agba, mata a bu na lomo, tasa mata a bu amboh nga agohsoh gaga, mata a bu na agohsoh kira na kyangwri mboh amboh soh ivoh yira.<verse eid="TIT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Tsana ifiya agbugba mboh za mata a lisa ika ata nza a bu yehlehleh ma aki tufa Nnoh reh, mata kama a de akyo ma agohsoh kpeh, ha mata a wa awumu te fya kpeh, neh mata ka a tsana andromboh ata nza a zohhoh. <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />Ma aki wohroh reh mata a tsana fya akǝkehreh mboh mata kira na tsitsifa amoh mboh tasa mara amoh mboh, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />mata a bu na lomo, mata a wina de ikpi amoh mboh, mata a lisa alindeh tasa te ndohmoh nimeh nashi amoh mboh, mata a bu fya alilehndeh ma tsitsifa amoh mboh neh ma a nati a sohroh a de tsifa Nnoh reh a te abibi kpeh.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Dehreh za tsana kafa tsifa mboh mata a bu amboh de ikpi amoh mboh alindeh. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Nimeh awumu mboh nambri, tsana ikpi anzoh la ni bu kyangwri lisa alindeh. Nnoh Titus lisa alindeh za kafa mboh reh mata a nza anyi na anzoh, tasa kama were ava ma aki tsana kpeh. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Tsana a zizi tsifa neh amboh ata nza ma a nza noh kpeh ma iyo mata a fa kavoh na sa tsifa anzoh leke. Dehreh neh amboh ata nza ma a nza noh kpeh ma iyo reh ta ka a te mboh na isa la maa a fa kavoh na bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi tsana ambohroh reh.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Tsana amboh ata nza ma a bu ahwra mboh reh mata a tufa tsifa agba amoh mboh nimeh awumu mboh nambri, ma ta ka a lisa mboh alindeh, mata kama atsifa abibi ma ikpi amoh kpeh, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />ha mata a te mboh ayuhu kpeh, neh mata ka a tsana la mboh ma a bu kyangwri a zizi tasa alindeh, la mata a de tsifa tsana ata Nnoh ambohroh reh a tsana la a zohhoh.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Nnoh kǝ vuru tsana lisa alindeh a ŋoh nza a ba ba a nga kyangwri nvara nambri. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />Lisa alindeh ata Nnoh reh a tsana reh la meh ti ta aki agugu reh tasa te iyo awumu ata inziyo, meh ti tuma ma agugu inziyo areh na lomo, tufa yehlehleh tasa gya agohsoh, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />tswanza mbohroh nza meh gya agohsoh ambohroh gaga ata te atoh nza meh tuma bana Nnoh agba ambohroh tasa ata Yeso Kristi, <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />a gu ikpi a ŋoh a nga kwo tsifa ambohroh, la Mbohroh meh ti nvara nyi ma kpakpana mboh gaga ta a de reh a te kyangwri a ŋoh mboh alilehndeh amboh lisa ndohmoh alilehndeh. <verse eid="TIT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Tsana amboh tufa mboh awumu amboh areh de aniye wuwa. Nga mboh wuwana, tsana aki alindeh ti kama kira akyo ta a rina nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Lisa Andromboh Ata Nza A zohhoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Kohnoh ma kyangwri anzoh mboh mata a nza agohgohmoh mboh tasa agbugba amboh de kpra ata gomnati na rishi, mata a sa tsifa amoh a kira tasa mata a kira te ndohmoh alindeh, <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />bleh mboh la mata kama tsifa abibi ma ikpi akyo kpeh, tasa za mata tuma alindeh tasa mata a bu na kuku ikpi na kyangwri mboh nambri.<verse eid="TIT 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Mbohroh za timi bu duduna mboh tasa amboh wuwa ikpi, tasa za maka landa reh tasa meh te ahwra ma aki kira awumu nana ata inziyo. Timi kǝ bu amboh de tsifa ma agohsoh tasa amboh te vene, tasa amboh leke itoh ambohroh. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Nnoh nza ka a vuru alindeh tasa kira a ŋoh a tsana reh neh, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />ka a nga reh nvara were a sohroh a bu tsifa te ndohmoh alindeh kpeh, neh a zaka a bu kwini a ŋoh ma. A hwara kpakpana ambohroh ka a nga reh huru tuma afeh ŋoh, <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Nnoh a were reh huru a ŋoh gaga were ma ikpi tsifa ata Yeso nza a ba ba a kwo ta a nga reh nvara reh, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />la ta a de reh a te yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh tsifa kwini a ŋoh tasa za ta a nga reh gya agohsoh la meh nati fene na a ŋoh ma inza. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Areh a bu tsifa a zizi. Meh kira ti tsana ma amboh ata nza ma a gya agohsoh amoh na Nnoh la mata ka a lisa andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh. amboh wohroh a ka a zohhoh ma kyangwri mboh nambri.<verse eid="TIT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Kama fi ikpi anzoh nimeh tsifa keh na aniye ata duduna kpeh tasa tsifa alohsoh amboh kiri tasa tsifa were gohroh ma ikpi amgbasho akpi reh kpeh, amboh wohroh reh maka a sohroh a de rya tohmoh a ba kpeh. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Nza akyo anyi a leh a de gafana a ba nimeh amohnoh, hwa nnoh te na afri nza a leke neh ti kǝ yi nnoh ta tsehe. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Wina la kyangwri ika wohroh agohsoh a ŋoh a bu abibi, a wina la kpakpana a ŋoh a shimba ŋoh akpi.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Ablusu Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Nza meh tohmoh Artima ha Tikiku ba na anzoh, ti fa aki ti ba na amya ma Nikafoli, mya meh kira meh ti tre ameh a ba ma a huru. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Kavohshama fa aki ti shingi nnoh Zena kyangwri hwra akpi reh tasa Afolo la mata kama a fa andromboh anyi kavoh kpeh ma aki hende reh. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Kyangwri ambohroh amboh tufa mboh mata a fi ikpi amoh nimeh ndohmoh la mata ka a shingi amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh iya kanga, la mata kama tuma were kpeh. <verse eid="TIT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a yama na amya ma mareh ma tsifa na amohnoh. Tsifa meh noh na amboh ata nza ma a kira na ambohroh nza ma a bu amboh tufa amboh nza ma a yama ma a huru, meh kwere Nnoh la alindeh a ŋoh ta a bu na amohnoh nambri.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>